#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:6
msgid "# Installation"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:9
msgid ""
"> Deploy FreeAnima on your machine — npm CLI, Docker Compose, or from "
"source.  > After install: [`security.md`](security.md) (credentials, bind "
"address) · [`database.md`](database.md) (PostgreSQL) · [`service.md`]"
"(service.md) (runtime commands)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:11
msgid "## Choose a path"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Path               | Best for                                   | PostgreSQL  | Redis                  | Credentials                                          |\n"
"| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------ | ----------- | ---------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **npm CLI**        | Day-to-day self-hosting on your OS         | You install | Optional (recommended) | [pass](https://www.passwordstore.org/) (recommended) |\n"
"| **Docker Compose** | Quick trial, minimal host setup            | Bundled     | Bundled                | `.env` env vars                                      |\n"
"| **Source**         | Contributors, bleeding-edge, custom builds | You install | Optional (recommended) | pass (recommended)                                   |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:19
msgid ""
"All paths run the same `anima service` runtime (WebUI + tRPC + Gateway + "
"engine). PostgreSQL with **pgvector** is **required**. Redis powers fridge/"
"tasks cross-session context and **degrades silently** when unavailable — "
"Docker and production setups should still run it."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:21
msgid "## Shared prerequisites"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Component      | Version / notes                                                                                                                                    |\n"
"| -------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Bun**        | >= 1.3.14 — required for npm CLI and source installs ([bun.sh](https://bun.sh))                                                                    |\n"
"| **PostgreSQL** | 17 recommended; extensions: `vector`, FTS helpers — see [`database.md`](database.md)                                                               |\n"
"| **Redis**      | 7.x recommended; defaults to `127.0.0.1:6379` when configured                                                                                      |\n"
"| **pass**       | Optional but recommended for npm/source — API keys and DB URLs stay out of config files ([`security.md`](security.md#credential-responsibilities)) |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:30
msgid ""
"Data directory: `~/.anima/` (override with `FREEANIMA_HOME`). Back it up "
"with your database."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:34
msgid "## npm CLI"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:36
msgid ""
"The published package is [`@freeanima/cli`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/"
"@freeanima/cli) on npm. The binary is `anima`; runtime is Bun (not Node)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:38
msgid "### 1. Install Bun and the CLI"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:42
msgid ""
"```bash # Install Bun (https://bun.sh/docs/installation)  curl -fsSL https://"
"bun.sh/install | bash"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:45
msgid "# Global CLI from npm registry bun install -g @freeanima/cli"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:49
msgid "# Verify anima --help ```"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:51
msgid ""
"You can also use `npm install -g @freeanima/cli`, but `anima` still invokes "
"Bun — ensure `bun` is on your `PATH`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:53
msgid "### 2. Configure"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:59
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```bash\n"
"mkdir -p ~/.anima\n"
"chmod 700 ~/.anima\n"
"cp config.example.yaml ~/.anima/config.yaml   # from repo clone, or write manually\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:61
msgid "Minimum production settings in `~/.anima/config.yaml`:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/install.md:64
msgid "**`database.url`** — PostgreSQL connection string (required)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/install.md:64
msgid ""
"**`llm.providers.*`** — at least one OpenAI-compatible provider and profile "
"chain"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:66
msgid "Prefer pass for secrets:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:71
msgid ""
"```bash anima credential add api/openai token=sk-… anima credential add "
"services/postgres/anima url=postgresql://… host=… password=… database=anima "
"```"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:73
msgid ""
"Then reference them in config, e.g. `api_key: credential(\"api/openai\", "
"\"token\")` and `database.url: pass:services/postgres/anima`. See "
"[`security.md`](security.md#credential-responsibilities)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:75
msgid ""
"PostgreSQL setup (Debian helper, extensions, migrations): [`database.md`]"
"(database.md)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:77
msgid ""
"Optional Redis block in config (defaults shown in `config.example.yaml`):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:83
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```yaml\n"
"redis:\n"
"  host: 127.0.0.1\n"
"  port: 6379\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:85
msgid "### 3. Start the service"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:91
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```bash\n"
"anima service start              # background (systemd user unit when available)\n"
"anima service start --foreground # debug — logs to stdout\n"
"anima service status\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:93
msgid "Default bind: `127.0.0.1:2658`. Open parlor chat:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:95
#, no-wrap
msgid "**http://127.0.0.1:2658/webui/parlor/chat**\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:97
msgid ""
"Schema migrations run automatically on startup when `database.url` is set."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:99
msgid "### 4. Upgrade"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:103
msgid "```bash anima update ```"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:105
msgid ""
"Updates the global `@freeanima/cli` package from npm. Disabled for local "
"link installs — use git pull or rebuild instead."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:109
msgid "## Docker Compose"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:111
msgid ""
"Recommended for a **quick trial** with PostgreSQL, Redis, and the service in "
"one stack. The image installs `@freeanima/cli` globally and listens on "
"`0.0.0.0:2658` inside the container."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:113
msgid "### 1. Prepare environment"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:115
msgid ""
"From the repository root (or any directory with `docker-compose.yml` and "
"`.env.example`):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:119
msgid "```bash cp .env.example .env ```"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:121
msgid "Edit `.env`:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:129
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Variable          | Required | Description                                           |\n"
"| ----------------- | -------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `PG_PASSWORD`     | yes      | PostgreSQL password for user/db `freeanima`           |\n"
"| `OPENAI_API_KEY`  | yes      | LLM API key (injected into config template)           |\n"
"| `OPENAI_BASE_URL` | no       | Default `https://api.openai.com/v1`                   |\n"
"| `OPENAI_MODEL`    | no       | Default `gpt-4o-mini`                                 |\n"
"| `ANIMA_PORT`      | no       | Host port mapped to container `2658` (default `2658`) |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:131
msgid "### 2. Start the stack"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:135
msgid "```bash docker compose up --build ```"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:137
msgid "Services:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/install.md:141
msgid "**postgres** — `pgvector/pgvector:pg17`, database `freeanima`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/install.md:141
msgid "**redis** — `redis:7-alpine`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/install.md:141
msgid ""
"**freeanima** — `ghcr.io/freeanima-org/freeanima:latest` (built locally on "
"first `--build`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:143
msgid ""
"On first start, `docker/entrypoint.sh` copies `docker/config.docker.yaml` to "
"`$FREEANIMA_HOME/config.yaml` if missing. Persistent volumes: `pgdata`, "
"`anima_data`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:145
msgid "### 3. Access WebUI"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:149
msgid "```text http://127.0.0.1:2658/webui/parlor/chat ```"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:151
msgid "(Use `ANIMA_PORT` if you changed the host mapping.)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:153
msgid "### 4. Pull a release image (no local build)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:158
msgid "```bash docker compose pull docker compose up -d ```"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:160
msgid ""
"Images are published to `ghcr.io/freeanima-org/freeanima` on each release "
"tag."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:162
msgid "### Docker notes"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/install.md:166
msgid ""
"Secrets live in `.env` — do not commit `.env` to git. For production, prefer "
"a secret manager or pass on the host and mount config instead of plaintext "
"keys in `.env`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/install.md:166
msgid ""
"The container binds `0.0.0.0` — restrict access with firewall or reverse "
"proxy auth before exposing beyond localhost ([`security.md`](security.md))."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/install.md:166
msgid ""
"pass is **not** used inside the default Compose stack; LLM and DB "
"credentials come from environment variable expansion in `docker/"
"config.docker.yaml`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:170
msgid "## Source (repository)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:172
msgid "For development, unreleased fixes, or running from a git checkout."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:174
msgid "### 1. Clone and install dependencies"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:176
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Prerequisites:** Bun >= 1.3.14 · PostgreSQL (pgvector) · Redis (recommended) · pass (recommended)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:182
msgid ""
"```bash git clone https://github.com/freeanima-org/freeanima.git cd "
"freeanima bun install ```"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:184
msgid "### 2. Expose the `anima` command"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:186
msgid ""
"Link the workspace CLI into your Bun global bin (editable without rebuild):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:191
msgid "```bash bun run link:global anima --help ```"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:193
msgid "Alternatively, use the repo binary directly:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:199
msgid "```bash bun run anima -- --help # or ./cli/src/cli.ts --help ```"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:201
msgid "For a publish-shaped local install (closer to npm users):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:206
msgid "```bash bun run build:cli bun install -g ./cli/publish ```"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:208
msgid "### 3. Configure and start"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:210
msgid ""
"Same as npm CLI — `~/.anima/config.yaml`, PostgreSQL, optional Redis and "
"pass:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:215
msgid ""
"```bash mkdir -p ~/.anima cp config.example.yaml ~/.anima/config.yaml # "
"configure database + LLM (see database.md, security.md)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:218
msgid "anima service start --foreground ```"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:220
msgid ""
"WebUI dev mode (source watch rebuild — refresh the page after frontend "
"edits):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:224
msgid "```bash anima service start --dev --foreground ```"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:226
msgid "### 4. Development checks"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:231
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```bash\n"
"bun run check    # typecheck + lint + dep-check + format + changed unit tests\n"
"bun run test     # full unit + integration (integration uses Docker for temp PG)\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:233
msgid ""
"Upgrade a link install: `git pull`, `bun install`, restart the service. Do "
"not use `anima update`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:237
msgid "## Verify installation"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:242
msgid ""
"```bash anima service status curl -s http://127.0.0.1:2658/api/status | jq "
"'.version, .memory_kb' ```"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:244
msgid ""
"If status fails, check PostgreSQL connectivity and that migrations completed "
"([`database.md`](database.md#troubleshooting))."
msgstr ""

